## Workflow Reference
Implements: ai_toolkit/workflows/feature-delivery/verify-and-pr.md

# Verify and draft MR/PR

**Follow the workflow file verbatim.**

## Args

```text
<feature|plan-path> [--commit]
```

**Commit:** false unless `--commit` (then ask). Do not run tests unless the user asked.

## Load (once)

1. `ai_toolkit/workflows/feature-delivery/verify-and-pr.md`
2. Feature `plan.md`, `README.md` (Contract section), `memory.md` if present
3. `ai_docs/conventions.md` — verify command
4. `ai_specs/api/contracts/INDEX.md` — rows cited by the feature

## Handoff

≤10 lines: analyzer result, manual verify checklist, draft title/body, open TBDs, exact next command if blocked.
